## kloakwl drops to this unprivileged system user (and matching group) inside its
## in-process sandbox; it maps uid/gid 0 in its user namespace to this id. kloakwl
## FATALs if the user or group is absent, so it must exist before the service runs.
u kloakwl - "kloak Wayland adapter" /nonexistent /usr/sbin/nologin
